  "body_html": "<h1>wsum_pure</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem wsum_pure [DecidableEq I] (i₀ : I) (f : I → 𝕜) : wsum ⟨fun i =&gt; if i = i₀ then 1 else 0, fun i =&gt; by simp only; split_ifs &lt;;&gt; norm_num, by simp [Finset.sum_ite_eq', Finset.mem_univ]⟩ f = f i₀</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>wsum_pure_apply</li>\n</ul>",
